  "comment": [
    "TEMPORARY: remove this file once zstd-jni ships this metadata itself (it does not as of",
    "1.5.7-21). Same approach as ../../dev.dirs/reachability-metadata.json.",
    "",
    "Since 1.5.7-17, zstd-jni is a multi-release JAR: on JDK 22+, its stream classes",
    "(ZstdInputStreamNoFinalizer, ZstdOutputStreamNoFinalizer, the buffer streams) come from",
    "META-INF/versions/22 and call libzstd through java.lang.foreign rather than JNI. The image",
    "builder runs on JDK 25, so native images get that implementation, and every downcall it",
    "makes has to be registered here, or the image throws MissingForeignRegistrationError when",
    "cs unpacks a .tar.zst archive.",
    "",
    "The entries below are the distinct function descriptors of the downcall handles in",
    "com.github.luben.zstd.ZstdBinding (META-INF/versions/22), in this order:",
    "  1. the zstd_java_* constant getters (zstd_java_e_continue, ...), ZSTD_minCLevel, ZSTD_maxCLevel",
    "  2. ZSTD_CCtx_setParameter, ZSTD_DCtx_setParameter",
    "  3. ZSTD_registerSequenceProducer",
    "  4. ZSTD_compressBound",
    "  5. ZSTD_isError, ZSTD_getErrorCode",
    "  6. ZSTD_getErrorName",
    "  7. ZSTD_createCDict (critical)",
    "  8. ZSTD_createCDict_byReference",
    "  9. ZSTD_freeCDict, ZSTD_freeDDict, ZSTD_freeCStream, ZSTD_freeCCtx, ZSTD_freeDCtx, ZSTD_initDStream",
    " 10. ZSTD_createDDict (critical)",
    " 11. ZSTD_createDDict_byReference",
    " 12. ZSTD_CStreamOutSize, ZSTD_DStreamInSize, ZSTD_DStreamOutSize",
    " 13. ZSTD_createCStream, ZSTD_createCCtx, ZSTD_createDStream, ZSTD_createDCtx",
    " 14. ZSTD_CCtx_reset, ZSTD_DCtx_reset, ZSTD_initCStream",
    " 15. ZSTD_CCtx_loadDictionary, ZSTD_DCtx_loadDictionary (critical)",
    " 16. ZSTD_CCtx_refCDict, ZSTD_DCtx_refDDict",
    " 17. ZSTD_CCtx_setPledgedSrcSize ('long long' is the unsigned long long it takes)",
    " 18. ZSTD_compress2, ZSTD_decompressDCtx (critical)",
    " 19. ZSTD_compress2, ZSTD_decompressDCtx (non-critical variants, for native memory)",
    " 20. ZSTD_getFrameProgression, which returns ZSTD_frameProgression by value",
    " 21. ZSTD_compressStream2_simpleArgs (critical)",
    " 22. ZSTD_decompressStream_simpleArgs (critical)",
    " 23. ZSTD_findFrameCompressedSize (critical)",
    " 24. ZSTD_findFrameCompressedSize (non-critical)",
    " 25. zstd_java_decompressedSize (critical)",
    " 26. zstd_java_decompressedSize (non-critical)",
    " 27. ZSTD_getDictID_fromFrame, ZSTD_getDictID_fromDict (critical)",
    " 28. ZSTD_getDictID_fromFrame (non-critical)",
    " 29. ZSTD_decompress",
    " 30. ZDICT_trainFromBuffer",
    " 31. ZDICT_trainFromBuffer_legacy, which takes ZDICT_legacy_params_t by value",
    "Every handle is built in ZstdBinding's static initializer (which also calls each constant",
    "getter right away), so all of them get registered as soon as any zstd stream is touched,",
    "even the compression and dictionary ones cs never calls.",
    "ZstdBinding types every size_t as the linker's canonical 'size_t' layout and pointers as",
    "plain ValueLayout.ADDRESS, hence 'size_t' and 'void*' here. The 'critical' ones are linked",
    "with Linker.Option.critical(true) so heap byte[]s can be passed as pointers, which changes",
    "the generated stub, hence the option on those entries.",
    "",
    "The --enable-native-access=ALL-UNNAMED that goes with this lives in",
    "../../io.get-coursier/coursier-cli/native-image.properties."
  ],
